<title>UK: NTT Mobile Com sets 10 bln yen 6-year bond.</title>
<headline>NTT Mobile Com sets 10 bln yen 6-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Fuji International Finance.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NTT MOBILE COMMUNICATION NETWORK INC</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN YEN    COUPON     2.25	MATURITY    14.NOV.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   0.25</p>
<p> PAY DATE   14.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANNDENOMS (M) 100</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  JAPAN     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> SALE LIMS  US/UK/JAPAN</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
